  "notes": "Formed from {発|はつ} (to emit) + {語|ご} (word). A somewhat technical term, common in {言語|げんご}{発達|はったつ} (language development) and speech therapy.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {発語|はつご}{障害|しょうがい}: speech impairment\n- {初|はじ}めての{発語|はつご}: first words\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {発話|はつわ}: utterance — the more standard linguistics term\n- {発音|はつおん}: pronunciation — focuses on the sounds, not the act of speaking",
